<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HAB" style="id">Habakkuk</book>
  <para style="h">Habakkuk</para>
  <para style="toc1">Habakkuk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Habakkuk</para>
  <para style="mt">Habakkuk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kamsang Habakkuk in a mu thuphuon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa aw, bang tanvei huna hing ngenin, ei ngai loin om ding na hei? Na kungah, “Tatsietna!” ci-in kang kiko ciengin, ei hun lo ding na hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bang dingin gamtat khielnate le gimnate, ei musah na hei? Ka mai-ah kisietna le tatsietnate om a, kihauna le kiselnate a pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n thukham thanem a, thutang in guolzo ngai lo hi. Migilote in mi thumante imtawm uhi; tua ziehin thukhenna kilehei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Minamte enin mu vawi un! Lamdang sa un! Amtum un! Bangzieh ahei cile na kung vuah hing kigen nanle, na up lo ding uh nasep khat no hun sungin ka sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen keima in a hangsan le a nawtat ahi Chaldea-te ka vangliensah ding a, amau-a’ ahi lo tenna munte a la dingin, leitung muncin tengah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate zatah huoi-in giinhuoi mama uhi; amate kung panin a thudihna ule a kithupisahna uh a pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A sakolte uh kamkei sangin gangzaw a, khuomiel kuona gam-uite sangin giinhuoizaw hi; a sakolte un thakhahtin a sim uhi. Gamlapi panin a sakol galkapte ang pei uhi; sa man dinga ang nawlen muvanlai tawh kibang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A tatsie dingin a unpi-un ang pei vua, mai lam nawtin ang kuon uhi; amate in senel bangin gal kimante a khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpite a ciemmui bawl vua, gam-uhte apmaina-in a nei uhi. Amate in kulpi zosie a nuisan lel vua, kulpi lah nadingin lei a sungvum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in huipi lang bangin a nawtsuoh uhi; amate in a palsat vua, khielna neite a suoh uhi; amau’ thahatna pen amau’ pasien ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa ka Pasien, keima’ Siengtho Pa aw, nang tangtawng pan hi lo na hi amah? Nang na si sih ding hi. Topa aw, thukhenna thuoh dingin, amate na melci zo ta hi; suongpi aw, dan thuoh dingin, amate na se zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gitlona et nadingin na mitcim mama a, khielna na en thei sih hi; bang dingin a zuoutatte na et thei vanuh a, migilote in amate sanga thuman zawte a pumval ciengun zong, a ham loin om na hi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangma in tuipi sungah nga bangin mite na bawl a, amate pen uhpa a nei lo a awma kithol ganhingte tawh a kibang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A galpa in amate a unpi-in ngakuoi tawh a kai hi; ama in a len tawh khu-in tuate kaidawh a, a ngawilen sungah ama in tuate a khol hi; tuaci’n ama kipahin a lungdam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ama in a len kungah siem thoi a, a ngawilen kungah ama in biehnate a pie hi; azieh pen amate ziehin a tanh kicing a, a an a tui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hepina nei loin ama in minamte susie-in, a lente hawmsuoh sah ding amah?
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka galvilna tausang tungah dingin, leicien tungah ka pang ding hi; ama in keima kungah bang ei gen ding a, ama in ka phunna tungtang bang ei ci dawnkia ding ahei, ci ka en ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in kei ei dawng hi: A tai mipa khat’ sim thei dingin suongpehte tungah a kicienin, tua mangmuna giel in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />azieh pen a kise hun adingin mangmuna khat om lai hi; tua in hun tawp ding thu gen ding a, zuou lo ding hi. A kiheh tuoh lezong ngah in; ang tung valon ding a, ang kiheh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi kisatheite en vawi! A lungsim puoh uh a man sih hi, ahi vangin midihte ahi uleh amau’ upna ziehin a hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua banah hauna a zuou thei hi; mi kiliensahte kip lo hi. Misikhuo bangin a lawlte uh gol hi; amate in Sina ma bangin pha zo, ci hun a nei ngai sih uhi. Amate adingin minam zosie a khawmtuo vua, amau-a’ bangin minam zosie a kaikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi zosie in tua bang mite pen simmawna kam ahi thu hahsate tawh a tawh vua, “Amau-a’ ahi lopi nei le lam a vum a vala kholte in gimna a thuoh ding hi!” ci-in amate thu gen lo ding uh amah? Ang kipong vante tawh bang tanvei no le no hau sawm na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na sum ang leitawite thakhatin ang kuonin, hing phongin, hing citunsah lo ding uh amah? Tua ciengin amau’ tomgam van na suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minam tampite bulu zo na hi ziehin, a hinglai mi zosie in nang ang bulu ding hi. Leitunga khuopite le a sunga teng zosie tungah tatsietna tawh na bawl zieh le mi sisan na suosah ziehin, nang ang kibulu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Na innsung adingin a man lo tawh sum a nga, sietna in ang bat lo nadingin a sangna muna bu a tom nang in gimna na thuoh ding hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi tampi suhsietna tawh na innsung maizum nading gelin na hinna na tanlaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kul panin suongte kiko ding a, innsingte panin a kizut za in dawngkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Sisan suona tawh khuopi a lam le khielna tawh khuopi a sat nang in gimna na thuoh ding hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mei kahvam ding bepin mite in na a sem vua, minamte in kimanna a nei lo, gim nading bepa a sep uh pen, Vanglien Topa kung pana ang pei hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanle tuite in tuipi a tuom bangin, Topa’ minthanna theitheina tawh leitung a kidim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“A guohtanga a op uh na et nop ziehin na innvengte zu tekhamin, a kham masangsie uh na lungthahna a buohsuh nang in gimna na thuoh ding hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Minthanna tangin simmawna tawh nang na kilungkimsah ding hi. Nang le nang in dawn inlen zukhamin hawipua in! Topa’ ziet lama hai na tungah ang tung ding a, na minthanna tungah maizumna ang tung ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen leitunga khuopite le a sunga tengte zosie, tatsietna tawh a kibawl zieh le mihing sisan a kisuo ziehin, Lebanon tunga a kibawl tatsietna in ang nuoicip ding a, ganhingte kisuhsietna in nang ang zausah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hunkhat lai-in a bawlpa in a lem milim khu bangin kimang a, a kikhengtawm zuou milimte le zuou thuhil siete bangin kimang ahei? Azieh pen a bawlpa in a piensah na pen a ham thei lo milim khat ahi lel vangin, a bawlsa na tungah ama in muonna a nei hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sing kungah, “Khanglo ven!” ci-in, a ham theilo suong kungah, “Tho ven!” a ci pa in gimna a thuoh ding hi! Tua in a hil thei ding amah? En in, tua khu ngun le kham tawh kizut ahi a, a sungah hinna hu a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin a inn sungah Topa om a, ama mai-ah leitung zosie sip dide-in om ta uheh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Shigionoth in a genna dung zui-a kamsang Habakkuk thungetna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa aw, na minthanna ka za zo a, Topa aw, na silbawlte lamdang ka sa mama hi. Ko hunin hing thasuosah inlen, ko hunin hing kitheisah in; na thangpai ciengin na hepina phawh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Teman pan Pasien ang pei a, Paran Muol panin Siengtho Pa ang pei hi. Selah A minthanna in vante tuom a, ama kiphatna leitung a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A vangtang ni tawh kibang hi; a khut panin nizangte kikhaw a, khum munah a vanglietna a kiphuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama mai-ah gimna pei a, pulnatna in a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama khawlin leitung lawh hi; ama in en a, minamte citunsah hi. Tangtawng muolte a pawhkeh hi; ama’ tanglai lampi dung tengah kumtawn muoltangte tumsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cush-te’ puonbuhte sungah gimna ka mu hi; Midian gam puonbuh dalnate kithing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa aw, gunte tungah na lung thah amah? Ahi sihle na sakolte tungah tuongin na sakol leengte in gal a zaw ciengin, gunte tungah lungthahin tuipi tungah na thang a pai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na thallawng hawm na vih a, na thupiehna tawh thaltangte tamin na dei nawn sih hi. Selah leitung gunte tawh na khenkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Muolte in nang hing mu-in kizieltum uhi; tuikhang a kihot valuh hi; tui thuhpite a hawh vapuoh uhi. Ni in a sangna lamah a khutte lamto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kikhaw na thaltang kap le a tee lingleng na teipi ziehin, a thupi mama a opna-ah hlapi a dinkhawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A sinsosa-in leitungah na pei a, lungthahsa-in minamte na tuoncil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na mite hundam dingin na pei a, na sathau kinoite hundam dingin na kuon hi. A gilo inn sunga a makai pa na guoicimsah a, a khuombul panin a innkhum dongin na hawhmang hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kote ei thethang dinga huipi banga ang kuon a galhangte’ lutang khu ama’ thaltangte ma tawh na sun pailet a, a kiphuol mizawngte netum dinga a baisa-a om bangin na lung a dam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na sakolte tawh tuipi na tuoncil a, tui lienpite kilawh gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima in za-in ka sung a tun hi; tua a ging in ka nephu a tunsah hi. Ka gu ka tang teng a muot ding bang a, ka keng neilam tun dildel hi, keima in ei dote tunga a tung ding gentheina ni ka ngah khinkhian hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Theigate hut siengin, lenggate ga sih nanleh; olive kungte ga loin, lo-ah an pieng sih nanleh; tuubuh sunga tuute si siengin, ganbuh sunga gante om sih nanleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa sungah ka kipah veve ding a, ka hundampa ka Pasien tungah ka lungdam veve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa Pasien pen ka thahatna ahi hi; Ama in ka kengte sazuhpi keng bangsah a, mun sangte ei tuonsah hi. La makai pa kungah: A gui nei tumgingte tawh.
  </para>
</usx>
